{"id": "kept_s-f806397f7e80", "type": "rectangle", "x": 6100.0, "y": 627.5, "width": 3100.0, "height": 120.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-a6f9b725d24f", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 62, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 62, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-b1cf49ef8cf5", "type": "text", "x": 6132.5, "y": 657.5, "width": 2300.8109375, "height": 43.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-a6f9b725d24f", "roundness": null, "seed": 63, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 63, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "fn/ says what each command does, ref/ holds the contracts, scripts/ does the work: a command runs the same for a person and for an agent", "originalText": "fn/ says what each command does, ref/ holds the contracts, scripts/ does the work: a command runs the same for a person and for an agent", "fontSize": 35, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-d2c7947ea170", "type": "text", "x": 6100.0, "y": 802.5, "width": 396.20703125, "height": 53.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-a6f9b725d24f", "roundness": null, "seed": 64, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 64, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "📁 the skill, opened", "originalText": "📁 the skill, opened", "fontSize": 42, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-438e6194b722", "type": "text", "x": 6100.0, "y": 872.5, "width": 1011.4999999999999, "height": 962.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-a6f9b725d24f", "roundness": null, "seed": 65, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 65, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "haipipe-project/\n├── CHANGELOG.md     its versions\n├── README.md\n├── SKILL.md         the rules\n├── feedback/        1 files\n├── fn/              one page per command\n│   ├── audit.md         audit: read only, findings and fixes\n│   ├── digest.md        digest: harvest a session\n│   ├── feedback.md      feedback: capture a note\n│   ├── project.md       new: README.md and project.yaml\n│   ├── repo-project.md  repo: a Project kept as a submodule\n│   └── update.md        update: the dry run, then --apply\n├── ref/             the contracts\n│   ├── code-structure.md a software Project's code\n│   ├── ladder.md        the ladder table, read by ladder.py\n│   └── project-structure.md the root contract\n├── scripts/         its scripts\n│   ├── audit_projects.py the root's checks\n│   ├── ladder.py        audit and update below the root\n│   ├── link_check.py    links after a move\n│   ├── probe_tickets.py tickets after a move\n│   ├── project.py       new, repo and the list\n│   └── rename_themes.py the Theme rename (s01-D28)\n└── tests/           its tests\n    ├── test_ladder_s00.py\n    ├── test_ladder_workflow.py\n    ├── test_ladder_world.py\n    └── test_project_update.py update on a test Project", "originalText": "haipipe-project/\n├── CHANGELOG.md     its versions\n├── README.md\n├── SKILL.md         the rules\n├── feedback/        1 files\n├── fn/              one page per command\n│   ├──